#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: bomber.appdata.xml:6
msgid "Bomber"
msgstr "Bomber"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: bomber.appdata.xml:8
msgid ""
"Bomber is a single player arcade game. The player is invading various cities "
"in a plane that is decreasing in height."
msgstr ""
"Bomber je arkadna igra za jednog igrača. Igrač napada razne gradove avionom "
"koji smanjuje visinu."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: bomber.appdata.xml:11
msgid ""
"The goal of the game is to destroy all the buildings and advance to the next "
"level. Each level gets a bit harder by increasing the speed of the plane and "
"the height of the buildings."
msgstr ""
"Cilj igre je da uništite sve zgrade da bi prešli na sljedeći nivo. Svaki "
"nivo postaje malo teži povećanjem brzine aviona i visine zgrade."

#. (itstool) path: component/developer_name
#: bomber.appdata.xml:24
msgid "The KDE Community"
msgstr "KDE zajednica"
